<ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">Section, <ns0:ref href="/us/pl/88/352/tIV/s402">Pub. L. 88–352, title IV, § 402</ns0:ref>, <ns0:date date="1964-07-02">July 2, 1964</ns0:date>, <ns0:ref href="/us/stat/78/247">78 Stat. 247</ns0:ref>, authorized the Commissioner to conduct a survey and make a report to the President and the Congress within two years of July, 1964 concerning the availability of educational opportunities for minority group members.</ns0:p>
